## How to run

```bash
source scripts/load-secrets.sh    # if API keys needed
mvn spring-boot:run               # live run
```

## How to test

```bash
mvn test                          # unit tests
mvn verify                        # unit + integration tests
newman run test-data/postman/*.postman_collection.json  # API tests
```

## Key file locations

```
src/main/java/                    ← application code
src/main/resources/
  application.properties          ← configuration
src/main/docker/
  Containerfile                   ← UBI 10 multi-stage build
src/test/java/                    ← tests (*Test.java = unit, *IT.java = integration)
logs/                             ← file logging output (gitignored)
test-data/postman/                ← Postman collections
```

## Logging

File logging writes to `logs/{{PROJECT_NAME}}.log` with rotation.
Read with `Read logs/{{PROJECT_NAME}}.log` or `grep -n 'ERROR\|WARN' logs/{{PROJECT_NAME}}.log`.

## Useful commands

```bash
mvn spring-boot:run                              # run the app
curl -s http://localhost:8080/actuator/health    # liveness/readiness
curl -s http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus | grep app_   # metrics
kcat -b localhost:9092 -L                        # inspect Kafka topics/brokers
```
